ributing the cards to  him in petra zameet replies that he has  a cold but james is suspicious about it  mentioning that he does not care about  his grades james pretends to leave the  classroom but just then he grabs  zameet's box and rushes outside on  opening the box james learns that zamit  has been tricking him and petra by  tampering with their cards every single  time he returns to the classroom and  confronts zimit for his act calling it  cheating however zimit defends himself  by saying that he was trying to prepare  james for the real world scenario  bringing him out of his privileged life  james still does not believe his teacher  so he suggests that they go through the  third round of the thought exercise the  whole class also agrees and zamit is  forced to comply in the following scene  the group again arrives on an imaginary  island that is going to be attacked with  nuclear bombs as soon as they reach  there zumit goes to the bunker to do a  quick inspection of the place inside he  grabs a gun for himself and hides the  rest he hears a voice inside the bunker  but does not pay much attention to it  once outside petra goes to zimit and  gives him a warm hug mentioning that all  of them have been hard on him peter then  approaches the group and asks them to  trust her as she is going to select the  candidates this time everyone agrees and  the selection begins surprisingly petra  goes against zameet's suggestions and  starts choosing individuals who might  pose a risk or lack technical expertise  such as an opera singer and a poet petra  excludes herself and selects james to  fill the last spot for the bunker zimit  mentions that they will not remain alive  as the group she selected has no  expertise to prepare anything however  petra defends herself by saying that the  group can at least enjoy their time  while inside those artists are bound to  make some babies enraged with her choice  for not including him zameet reaches for  his bag for his gun but 